                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3f2880a-9f35-37b5-b546-4285c431e0a1",
                        "entry_id": "0ba7b54f-189b-33d1-be90-78df8597f7ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "fachidiot (a specialist expert who is ignorant outside of their specialty)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "masculine",
                            "weak"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf5e9c90-242d-4fa2-8d48-12075b698563",
                                "sense_id": "e3f2880a-9f35-37b5-b546-4285c431e0a1",
                                "text": "1895, A. W., De proletariis philologis, p. 815, in: Die Neue Zeit. Revue des geistigen und öffentlichen Lebens. Dreizehnter Jahrgang. Erster Band, Stuttgart, p. 814ff.",
                                "translation": "(please add an English translation of this quotation)",
                                "english": "(please add an English translation of this quotation)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1f3354e-b0be-413d-9793-5d88ed6ab9c1",
                                "sense_id": "e3f2880a-9f35-37b5-b546-4285c431e0a1",
                                "text": "Fortschrittsgläubiger Klugscheißer. Tüchtiger Fachidiot. Umgänglicher Technokrat. Betriebsblinder Menschenfreund. . . .",
                                "translation": "Progressive smart ass. Proficient specialist expert. Sociable technocrat. Business-blind philanthropist. . . .",
                                "english": "Progressive smart ass. Proficient specialist expert. Sociable technocrat. Business-blind philanthropist. . . ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b0df2d4-ba54-4c22-9d08-d112b66c0800",
                                "sense_id": "e3f2880a-9f35-37b5-b546-4285c431e0a1",
                                "text": "Kurzum, Sie haben die Wahl: entweder Fachidiot oder Verlierer. Im ersten Augenblick klingt »Fachidiot« schrecklich. Sie können's aber auch »Meisterschaft« nennen. Klingt schon verlockender, nicht? Beethoven war ein Fachidiot, aber was für einer: Er war der Weltbeste, wenn es ums Komponieren von Sinfonien ging.",
                                "translation": "In short, the choice is yours: either a nerd or a loser. At first glance, \"nerd\" sounds terrible. But you can also call it \"mastery\". Sounds more tempting, doesn't it? Beethoven was a specialist field idiot, but what a nerd: he was the best in the world when it came to composing symphonies.",
                                "english": "In short, the choice is yours: either a nerd or a loser. At first glance, \"nerd\" sounds terrible. But you can also call it \"mastery\". Sounds more tempting, doesn't it? Beethoven was a specialist field idiot, but what a nerd: he was the best in the world when it came to composing symphonies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
